    <h1>Intellectual Property</h1>
    <p class="ld-sub">BaseCamp Studio&reg; develops proprietary methodologies, creative systems and strategic processes. This page explains what we own and how it may be used.</p>
    <div class="ld-meta">Last updated: June 2026</div>
  </header>
  <article class="ld-body">
<section><h2><span class="n">01</span>Proprietary work</h2><p>BaseCamp Studio&reg; is a creative strategy company. The methodologies, frameworks and creative systems we develop are the result of significant investment and are protected as our intellectual property. This includes, without limitation:</p><ul><li>Strategic methodologies and creative frameworks</li><li>Naming systems and brand architectures</li><li>Creative concepts and presentations</li><li>Visual assets, renderings, motion graphics and films</li><li>UX/UI and website content</li><li>Photography and written content</li><li>Software components and internal operational systems</li><li>Documentation</li></ul></section>
<section><h2><span class="n">02</span>Use and reproduction</h2><p>Reproduction, redistribution, modification or commercial use of any BaseCamp Studio&reg; intellectual property requires our prior <strong>written authorization</strong>. Access to materials &mdash; including during a pitch, proposal or engagement &mdash; does not transfer ownership or grant a license.</p></section>
<section><h2><span class="n">03</span>Trademarks &amp; proprietary initiatives</h2><div class="ld-callout"><p><strong>BaseCamp Studio&reg;</strong> is a registered trademark and must be identified accordingly.</p><p><strong>THE KIT&trade;</strong> is a proprietary methodology of BaseCamp Studio. This is not yet a registered trademark and is not presented as such.</p></div></section>
<section><h2><span class="n">04</span>Client materials</h2><p>Intellectual property created specifically for a client is governed by the terms of the relevant engagement agreement. Our underlying methodologies, tools and know-how remain the property of BaseCamp Studio&reg;.</p></section>
<section><h2><span class="n">05</span>Reporting concerns</h2><p>To request authorization or report suspected misuse of our intellectual property, contact <a class="inl" href="mailto:hello@basecampstudio.pk">hello@basecampstudio.pk</a>.</p></section>
  </article>
